            "content": "```python\nfrom collections import Counter\n\n# Get all playlists\nall_playlists = []\npage_index = 0\nwhile True:\n    page = apis.spotify.show_playlist_library(\n        access_token=spotify_access_token,\n        page_index=page_index,\n        page_limit=20\n    )\n    if not page:\n        break\n    all_playlists.extend(page)\n    if len(page) < 20:\n        break\n    page_index += 1\n\n# Collect unique song IDs across all playlists\nunique_song_ids = set()\nfor pl in all_playlists:\n    details = apis.spotify.show_playlist(playlist_id=pl[\"playlist_id\"], access_token=spotify_access_token)\n    for song in details.get(\"songs\", []):\n        unique_song_ids.add(song[\"id\"])\n\n# Count artists across unique songs\nartist_counter = Counter()\nfor song_id in unique_song_ids:\n    song = apis.spotify.show_song(song_id=song_id)\n    for artist in song.get(\"artists\", []):\n        artist_counter[artist[\"name\"]] += 1\n\ntop_6_artists = [name for name, _ in artist_counter.most_common(6)]\nresult = \", \".join(top_6_artists)\nprint(result)\n\napis.supervisor.complete_task(answer=result)\n```",
